{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-and-serverless","title":"边缘计算与 Serverless 中的 WebAssembly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/edge-and-serverless","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘计算与-serverless-中的-webassembly\">边缘计算与 Serverless 中的 WebAssembly</h1><p>&quot;如果 2008 年就有 WASM 和 WASI，Docker 可能就不需要了。&quot; Solomon Hykes（Docker 联合创始人）2019 年的这句话在 2026 年以一种务实的方式成真——不是替代容器，而是在容器力所不及的场景（亚毫秒冷启动、百万级实例密度、全球边缘分布）中开辟了新的执行层。Cloudflare Workers、Fastly Compute、Fermyon Spin 和 SpinKube 正在将 Wasm 组件作为边缘计算的原生部署单元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Wasm 在边缘计算中的核心价值来自三个特性：亚毫秒冷启动（无文件系统/运行时初始化）、极低内存占用（1-10MB/实例 vs 容器的 50-200MB）、确定性沙箱隔离（Wasm VM 硬保证）。Cloudflare Workers、Fastly Compute 和 Fermyon Spin 是三个主要的生产级平台。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么边缘选择-wasm\">为什么边缘选择 Wasm</h2><p>边缘计算的核心约束是：低延迟（离用户近）、高密度（一台机器运行数千服务）、快启动（请求到达时才实例化）。容器在这三个维度都面临挑战：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>容器</th>\n<th>Wasm 组件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>100ms - 数秒</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms（预编译模块）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>50-200MB / 实例</td>\n<td>1-10MB / 实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署产物</td>\n<td>50-500MB 镜像</td>\n<td>1-10MB .wasm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙箱隔离</td>\n<td>内核 namespace + cgroup</td>\n<td>Wasm VM 硬隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动确定性</td>\n<td>不确定（依赖加载顺序）</td>\n<td>确定性（无后台进程）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Wasm 组件的冷启动时间是<strong>微秒级</strong>，因为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>没有文件系统解压/挂载</li>\n<li>没有动态链接器</li>\n<li>没有运行时初始化（无 JVM/V8 启动）</li>\n<li>预编译（AOT）的机器码直接映射到内存执行</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"边缘平台全景\">边缘平台全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;商业边缘平台&quot;&#10;        A[Cloudflare Workers&lt;br/&gt;V8 isolate + Wasm]&#10;        B[Fastly Compute&lt;br/&gt;纯 Wasmtime]&#10;        C[Fermyon Cloud&lt;br/&gt;Spin framework]&#10;        D[Azure Container Apps&lt;br/&gt;SpinKube]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;开源框架&quot;&#10;        E[Spin&lt;br/&gt;Fermyon]&#10;        F[wasmCloud&lt;br/&gt;CNCF sandbox]&#10;        G[Lunatic&lt;br/&gt;Erlang-like]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Kubernetes 集成&quot;&#10;        H[SpinKube&lt;br/&gt;containerd shim]&#10;        I[runwasi&lt;br/&gt;containerd Wasm shim]&#10;        J[Kwasm&lt;br/&gt;Kubernetes operator]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"商业边缘平台\"\n        A[Cloudflare Workers&lt;br/&gt;V8 isolate + Wasm]\n        B[Fastly Compute&lt;br/&gt;纯 Wasmtime]\n        C[Fermyon Cloud&lt;br/&gt;Spin framework]\n        D[Azure Container Apps&lt;br/&gt;SpinKube]\n    end\n    subgraph \"开源框架\"\n        E[Spin&lt;br/&gt;Fermyon]\n        F[wasmCloud&lt;br/&gt;CNCF sandbox]\n        G[Lunatic&lt;br/&gt;Erlang-like]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Kubernetes 集成\"\n        H[SpinKube&lt;br/&gt;containerd shim]\n        I[runwasi&lt;br/&gt;containerd Wasm shim]\n        J[Kwasm&lt;br/&gt;Kubernetes operator]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"cloudflare-workers\">Cloudflare Workers</h3><p>Cloudflare Workers 在全球 300+ 数据中心运行，支持 JavaScript 和 Wasm。其 Wasm 支持基于 V8 引擎的 Wasm 编译器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 在 Cloudflare Worker 中使用 Wasm&#10;import init, { process } from &#39;./wasm-lib/pkg&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default {&#10;  async fetch(request) {&#10;    await init();&#10;    const body = await request.arrayBuffer();&#10;    const result = process(new Uint8Array(body));&#10;    return new Response(result);&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Cloudflare Worker 中使用 Wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { process } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './wasm-lib/pkg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(body));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Workers 的独特优势：全球分布 + 0ms 冷启动（预热实例池）+ 与 Cloudflare 的 KV/R2/D1 存储深度集成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fastly-compute\">Fastly Compute</h3><p>Fastly 是最早全面押注 Wasm 的边缘平台——底层直接运行 Wasmtime，没有 V8 层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use fastly::{http::StatusCode, Request, Response};&#10;&#10;#[fastly::main]&#10;fn main(req: Request) -&gt; Result&lt;Response, fastly::Error&gt; {&#10;    let beresp = req.send(&quot;backend&quot;)?;&#10;&#10;    let mut resp = Response::new();&#10;    resp.set_status(StatusCode::OK);&#10;    resp.set_body(format!(&quot;Backend returned: {}&quot;, beresp.get_status()));&#10;    Ok(resp)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use fastly::{http::StatusCode, Request, Response};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[fastly::main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main(req: Request) -> Result&#x3C;Response, fastly::Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let beresp = req.send(\"backend\")?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut resp = Response::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resp.set_status(StatusCode::OK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resp.set_body(format!(\"Backend returned: {}\", beresp.get_status()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(resp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Fastly Compute 的请求处理延迟可低至微秒级，因为不需要 JS 引擎启动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"fermyon-spin\">Fermyon Spin</h3><p>Spin 是 Fermyon 开发的开源 Wasm 微服务框架，专为 Component Model 设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# spin.toml&#10;spin_manifest_version = 2&#10;&#10;[[trigger.http]]&#10;route = &quot;/api/...&quot;&#10;component = &quot;my-api&quot;&#10;&#10;[component.my-api]&#10;source = &quot;target/wasm32-wasip2/release/my_api.wasm&quot;&#10;[component.my-api.build]&#10;command = &quot;cargo component build --release&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># spin.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>spin_manifest_version = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[trigger.http]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>route = \"/api/...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>component = \"my-api\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[component.my-api]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source = \"target/wasm32-wasip2/release/my_api.wasm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[component.my-api.build]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>command = \"cargo component build --release\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 本地开发&#10;spin up&#10;&#10;# 部署到 Fermyon Cloud&#10;spin deploy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 本地开发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署到 Fermyon Cloud</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spin 的核心特点是每个请求创建一个新的 Wasm 实例——实例间完全隔离，无共享状态（无需锁）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"spinkube-wasm-进入-kubernetes\">SpinKube：Wasm 进入 Kubernetes</h2><p>SpinKube 通过 containerd 的 Wasm shim 让 Wasm 组件作为 Kubernetes Pod 运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Kubernetes manifest&#10;apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: wasm-service&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      runtimeClassName: wasmtime-spin # 使用 Wasm 运行时&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: app&#10;          image: ghcr.io/myorg/my-wasm-app:v1&#10;          resources:&#10;            limits:&#10;              memory: &#39;64Mi&#39; # Wasm 实例内存极小&#10;              cpu: &#39;100m&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Kubernetes manifest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">wasm-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      runtimeClassName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">wasmtime-spin</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 使用 Wasm 运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io/myorg/my-wasm-app:v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'64Mi'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # Wasm 实例内存极小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100m'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SpinKube 的优势：复用 Kubernetes 的调度/网络/可观测性基础设施，同时获得 Wasm 的冷启动和密度优势。Azure Container Apps 已正式支持此方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能基准\">性能基准</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>Node.js (容器)</th>\n<th>Wasm (Spin)</th>\n<th>差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>300-800ms</td>\n<td>0.5-2ms</td>\n<td>150-400x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存/实例</td>\n<td>50-150MB</td>\n<td>2-8MB</td>\n<td>10-50x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求/秒/核</td>\n<td>5,000-15,000</td>\n<td>20,000-50,000</td>\n<td>3-5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部署产物</td>\n<td>100-300MB</td>\n<td>1-5MB</td>\n<td>50-100x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>10-50ms</td>\n<td>1-5ms</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些数据来自 Fermyon 和 Fastly 的公开基准测试，实际结果取决于工作负载特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产案例\">生产案例</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公司</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Shopify</td>\n<td>自研 + Wasmtime</td>\n<td>商家自定义函数（折扣/配送逻辑）</td>\n<td>数百万商家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare</td>\n<td>Workers</td>\n<td>全球请求处理</td>\n<td>数十亿请求/天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fastly</td>\n<td>Compute</td>\n<td>CDN 边缘逻辑</td>\n<td>生产 GA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fermyon</td>\n<td>Spin + SpinKube</td>\n<td>微服务</td>\n<td>企业客户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Disney+</td>\n<td>Fastly Compute</td>\n<td>内容个性化</td>\n<td>全球流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1Password</td>\n<td>Wasmtime embed</td>\n<td>密码学逻辑隔离</td>\n<td>数千万用户</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"开发工作流\">开发工作流</h2><p>典型的边缘 Wasm 开发循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[编写 Rust/JS/Python] --&gt; B[cargo component build&lt;br/&gt;或 jco componentize]&#10;    B --&gt; C[spin up&lt;br/&gt;本地测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D[spin deploy&lt;br/&gt;或 kubectl apply]&#10;    D --&gt; E[全球边缘运行]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可观测性&lt;br/&gt;traces/metrics]&#10;    F --&gt;|反馈| A\">graph LR\n    A[编写 Rust/JS/Python] --&gt; B[cargo component build&lt;br/&gt;或 jco componentize]\n    B --&gt; C[spin up&lt;br/&gt;本地测试]\n    C --&gt; D[spin deploy&lt;br/&gt;或 kubectl apply]\n    D --&gt; E[全球边缘运行]\n    E --&gt; F[可观测性&lt;br/&gt;traces/metrics]\n    F --&gt;|反馈| A</pre><h3 id=\"本地开发体验\">本地开发体验</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 创建 Spin 项目&#10;spin new -t http-rust my-edge-service&#10;cd my-edge-service&#10;&#10;# 构建 + 本地运行（热重载）&#10;spin watch&#10;&#10;# 测试&#10;curl http://localhost:3000/api/hello\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建 Spin 项目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http-rust</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-edge-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-edge-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 + 本地运行（热重载）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">spin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> watch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:3000/api/hello</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"局限与权衡\">局限与权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>缓解方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无长连接</td>\n<td>请求/响应模型，无 WebSocket 常驻</td>\n<td>WASI 0.3 async 改善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无本地状态</td>\n<td>每次请求新实例，无进程内缓存</td>\n<td>外部 KV/Redis</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试困难</td>\n<td>生产环境无 attach debugger</td>\n<td>结构化日志 + tracing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态不成熟</td>\n<td>库需要 WASI 兼容</td>\n<td>快速改善中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准碎片化</td>\n<td>平台间差异（Workers vs Spin vs Fastly）</td>\n<td>Component Model 统一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Wasm 在边缘计算中的核心优势：亚毫秒冷启动、极低内存、确定性沙箱</li>\n<li>Cloudflare Workers (V8+Wasm)、Fastly Compute (Wasmtime)、Spin (Component Model) 是三大平台选择</li>\n<li>SpinKube 让 Wasm 组件以 Kubernetes Pod 方式调度，复用 K8s 生态</li>\n<li>生产案例覆盖 Shopify、Disney+、Cloudflare 等全球级流量</li>\n<li>Component Model 正在统一边缘平台间的接口碎片化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"component-model-and-wit\">Component Model 与 WIT</a>：组件的接口定义与跨语言组合</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/patterns/worker-pools\">Worker Pool 模式</a>：类比边缘 Wasm 实例池的预热与调度策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘计算与 Serverless 中的 WebAssembly","id":"边缘计算与-serverless-中的-webassembly"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么边缘选择 Wasm","id":"为什么边缘选择-wasm"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘平台全景","id":"边缘平台全景"},{"level":3,"text":"Cloudflare Workers","id":"cloudflare-workers"},{"level":3,"text":"Fastly Compute","id":"fastly-compute"},{"level":3,"text":"Fermyon Spin","id":"fermyon-spin"},{"level":2,"text":"SpinKube：Wasm 进入 Kubernetes","id":"spinkube-wasm-进入-kubernetes"},{"level":2,"text":"性能基准","id":"性能基准"},{"level":2,"text":"生产案例","id":"生产案例"},{"level":2,"text":"开发工作流","id":"开发工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"本地开发体验","id":"本地开发体验"},{"level":2,"text":"局限与权衡","id":"局限与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Component Model 与 WIT 接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/component-model-and-wit"},"next":null}